    "body": "Part of #36833\n\nThis PR adds local tracking of recent stale tips for [BIP 332](https://github.com/bitcoin/bips/blob/master/bip-0332.md).\nThe feature is behind a new `-staletips=<mode>` option (default `none`). There is no P2P change yet: with `-staletips=headers` the node only tracks tips.\n\n### Key changes\n\n* A new `AcceptedStaleTip` validation notification feeds the staletips tracker.\n* The tracker is built from the block index at startup, keeping the tips with the most work.\n  *  At most 10 tips are tracked. When the tracker is full, a new tip evicts the one with the least work, but only if the new tip has more work.\n* `getchaintips` RPC updates\n  * Add new options `max_depth` and `staletips_only`\n  * Report `fork_point` for each non-active tip.\n\nTest networks get the stricter policies the BIP recommends:\n* **signet:** only tips whose block has been validated, and one header variant per block. \n* **testnet3/4:** only tips with a difficulty of at least about 1,000,000.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Sample output (regtest, after a reorg replaced the tip at height 111)</summary>\n\n```\n$ bitcoin-cli getchaintips\n[\n  {\n    \"height\": 112,\n    \"hash\": \"544a1c7f23c96990e2db9f4415f498d1ee61effac8e7416ec53fb91f538b2d2c\",\n    \"branchlen\": 0,\n    \"status\": \"active\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"height\": 111,\n    \"hash\": \"3a0797803400d80abdbf34f73df33f760c1e24696531746f975e3041055b6967\",\n    \"branchlen\": 1,\n    \"fork_point\": \"43765e057b6cde12df1701595d90ae51cf80490fef1343edd2d3fbe2edf3958e\",\n    \"status\": \"valid-fork\"\n  }\n]\n\n$ bitcoin-cli -named getchaintips staletips_only=true\n[\n  {\n    \"height\": 111,\n    \"hash\": \"3a0797803400d80abdbf34f73df33f760c1e24696531746f975e3041055b6967\",\n    \"branchlen\": 1,\n    \"fork_point\": \"43765e057b6cde12df1701595d90ae51cf80490fef1343edd2d3fbe2edf3958e\",\n    \"status\": \"valid-fork\"\n  }\n]\n```\n\n</details>",
