      ],
      "message": "validation: add AcceptedStaleTip notification\n\nNotify validation interface listeners when a header or block is\naccepted that is not on the active chain and has no more work than\nthe active tip. BIP 332 stale-tip tracking, added in later commits,\nuses this.\n\nHeaders from one ProcessNewBlockHeaders() call are coalesced into one\nnotification for the last new header. A block is notified again when\nits data is stored.\n\nCo-authored-by: woltx <94266259+w0xlt@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Anthony Towns <aj@erisian.com.au>",
