      "message": "staletips: add bounded stale-tip tracker\n\nAdd StaleTipTracker, which keeps up to MAX_ADVERTISED_STALETIPS\nrecent stale tips that are eligible for relay under BIP 332. When\nfull, it evicts the tip with the least work.\n\nAdd BlockTree to test/util/blocktree.h so later tests can share it.\n\nCo-authored-by: woltx <94266259+w0xlt@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Anthony Towns <aj@erisian.com.au>",
