      "message": "staletips: apply test-network tracking policies\n\nTest networks are less protected by proof of work, so BIP 332\nrecommends stricter stale-tip policies there. On signet, only track\ntips whose block has been validated, and one header variant per\nblock. On testnet3 and testnet4, only track tips with a difficulty\nof at least about 1,000,000.\n\nCo-authored-by: woltx <94266259+w0xlt@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Anthony Towns <aj@erisian.com.au>",
