      "message": "staletips: seed tracker from the block index\n\nThe tracker is not persisted, so add SeedFromBlockIndex() to rebuild\nit at startup from the eligible stale tips in the block index.\nCandidates go through AddStaleTip(), so the same policies apply as\nat runtime.\n\nCo-authored-by: woltx <94266259+w0xlt@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Anthony Towns <aj@erisian.com.au>",
