      "message": "init: add -staletips option\n\nAdd -staletips=<mode> to opt in to BIP 332 stale-tip relay. For now\n'headers' only enables stale-tip tracking, which the next commits\nadd; later PRs add relay behind the same mode.\n\nMake the PeerManager ApplyArgsManOptions() return util::Result, like\nthe other ApplyArgsManOptions() helpers, so an invalid mode is\nreported at startup.\n\nCo-authored-by: woltx <94266259+w0xlt@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Anthony Towns <aj@erisian.com.au>",
