      "message": "rpc: add max_depth and fork_point to getchaintips\n\nAdd an optional max_depth argument that limits getchaintips to tips at\nmost that many blocks below the active tip, and report fork_point for\neach tip that is not on the active chain.\n\nThis lets callers find recent forks without listing every old stale\nbranch on mainnet or walking back each branch to its fork point.",
